# Keep the build context small and free of artifacts that would bust the layer
# cache on the remote builder. The image builds both the Rust backend and the
# Angular frontend, so frontend sources stay in — only their build artifacts and
# installed dependencies are excluded (the image reinstalls/rebuilds them).
.git
.github
.claude
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
frontend/public/wasm
*.md
